      "text": "The god of Moab (1 Kgs. 11:7); also of Ammon (Judg. 11:24). Solomon built for him a high place on Mount Olivet (1 Kgs. 11:7), which Josiah destroyed (2 Kgs. 23:13). Chemosh was worshipped with human sacrifices (2 Kgs. 3:27). See also Moabite Stone.",
